      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_Hodge%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "East Hodge sits on high ground between the Dugdemona River to the northwest and the Little Dugdemona River to the south.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
