      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_Hodge%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "East Hodge is part of the Ruston Micropolitan Statistical Area in north-central Louisiana.",
